This patch enables the existing late physical data-preview hook for mode six.
It changes only the mode-comparison immediate, preserving the accepted wakeup
instruction trigger, selection suppression, code size, and replay addresses.
The resulting image dedicates mode six to the joint wake-replay plus late-data
experiment; it does not retain the old mode-two late-data behavior.

--- a/arch/riscv/include/asm/switch_to.h
+++ b/arch/riscv/include/asm/switch_to.h
@@ -169,7 +169,7 @@ static __always_inline void riscv_bp_preview_late(struct task_struct *next)
 {
 	unsigned long paddr0, paddr1, paddr2, paddr3;
 
-	if (READ_ONCE(next->thread.bp_preview_phys_mode) != 2
+	if (READ_ONCE(next->thread.bp_preview_phys_mode) != 6
 	    || READ_ONCE(next->thread.bp_preview_phys_mm) != next->mm
 	    || !next->mm)
 		return;
